  "label": "Gender expression",
  "description": "The external manifestation of one’s gender identity through clothing, behavior, voice, and appearance. Drag is a form of gender expression that challenges traditional gender norms. The visual of the drag performer’s bold makeup and costume is a direct representation of gender expression, which is central to the meme’s message about identity and acceptance.",
